(footprint "RP2350_Zero_Header_23p"
  (version 20221018)
  (generator "handwritten")
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "RP2350-Zero pin-socket footprint (female, board side), 23 physical pins (20 GPIO + 5V/GND/3V3). Origin = module center. LAYOUT CORRECTED 2026-08-21 (two rounds): (1) user physically counted the real module's pins and found right column = 9 (not 8) and bottom row = 5 (not 6), left column stays 9; (2) user then pointed out RP2350-Zero is explicitly sold as fitting a standard 2.54mm perfboard grid, so all 23 holes must sit on ONE uniform 2.54mm grid -- the earlier per-image sub-pixel offset readings (e.g. non-grid Y values for the right column) were unreliable for the same reason the pin count was originally misread, and were discarded in favor of pure grid math. Final layout, all coordinates exact 2.54mm-grid multiples: Left column (9 pins, X=-7.62mm): Y=+10.16,+7.62,+5.08,+2.54,0,-2.54,-5.08,-7.62,-10.16 = 5V,GND,3V3,GP29,GP28,GP27,GP26,GP15,GP14 (top to bottom). Right column (9 pins, X=+7.62mm): SAME Y values as left column (Y-symmetric) = GP0,GP1,GP2,GP3,GP4,GP5,GP6,GP7,GP8 (top to bottom). Bottom row (5 pins, Y=-12.70mm, one grid step below the last left/right row, centered on X=0): X=-5.08,-2.54,0,+2.54,+5.08 = GP13,GP12,GP11,GP10,GP9 (left to right); GP12/GP13 = USB host D+/D-, adjacent by construction. Pin IDENTITIES (which physical pin carries which GPIO name, e.g. left-to-right order in each row) are still not individually re-confirmed against the Waveshare wiki pinout image -- only the pin COUNT and GRID POSITIONING are now high-confidence. Visually compare against the wiki pinout image before gerber ordering.")
  (tags "RP2350-Zero header socket 23pin")
  (attr through_hole)
  (fp_text reference "REF**" (at 0 -14) (layer "F.SilkS")
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)))
  )
  (fp_text value "RP2350_Zero_Header_23p" (at 0 14) (layer "F.Fab")
    (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15)))
  )
  (fp_text user "USB-C / BOOT-RUN side" (at 0 10.9) (layer "F.SilkS")
    (effects (font (size 0.8 0.8) (thickness 0.12)))
  )
  (fp_text user "pin IDENTITY not re-confirmed vs wiki image (count+grid are confirmed)" (at 0 -10.9) (layer "Cmts.User")
    (effects (font (size 0.8 0.8) (thickness 0.12)))
  )
  (pad "1" thru_hole circle (at -7.62 10.16) (size 1.6 1.6) (drill 1.0) (layers "*.Cu" "*.Mask"))
  (pad "2" thru_hole circle (at -7.62 7.62) (size 1.6 1.6) (drill 1.0) (layers "*.Cu" "*.Mask"))
